# Delete your Chord Library account

Chord Library by PotatoChips (developer: Samsi Bagyarta)

## In the app
Open Chord Library, tap ⋮ (top right) → **Delete account** → **Delete**.
Tick "Also remove the songs I shared" to remove your Community Chord uploads too.

## By email
Email **potatochips0692@gmail.com** from the Google account you signed in with,
subject "Delete my account". We act on it within 30 days.

## What is deleted
- Your email address and your Community Chord account
- Your daily usage counters
- The songs you shared, if you ask for it

## What is kept, and for how long
- Activity and report log entries: deleted automatically 12 months after they were made
- A record of violations: 12 months; a permanent ban: for as long as it applies

Songs saved on your phone are never part of the account; uninstalling the app removes them.
